    Publish the marker-v2 writer golden
    
    Managers write install marker schema 2 for every schema 1 through 6
    installation mutation, but the shared fixture published only
    expected/marker.json, the frozen marker-v1 legacy-read evidence. A
    downstream consumer comparing its own writer output against that file
    sees a schema mismatch it cannot resolve without either rewriting
    release history or dropping the writer assertion.
    
