    installation with exactly schema_version, build_roots and builds
    changed. The golden skill activates no compiled command, so builds is
    empty and build_source stays absent. expected/marker.json is untouched.
    
    The validator and the rc.6 release gate now require the writer golden,
    reject an in-place edit of the frozen legacy marker, and reject a writer
    golden that carries build state the fixture has none of, declares
    build_source without builds, leaves the schema 1 through 6 range, or
    describes a different installation.

